<html>
  <head>
    <script type="application/jay-data">
data:
    connectionMessage: string
    connected: boolean
    fileCount: number
    statusMessage: string
    </script>
    <style>
      .wix-media-settings {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 24px;
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        color: #162d3d;
      }
      .wix-media-settings h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 20px; }
      .wix-media-settings section {
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding-top: 16px;
        border-top: 1px solid #d8e0e6;
      }
      .wix-media-settings .status-card {
        padding: 12px 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #f4f7f9;
        border: 1px solid #d8e0e6;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      .wix-media-settings .status-card.ok {
        background: #edf8f0;
        border-color: #b9dfc4;
      }
      .wix-media-settings .status-card.warn {
        background: #fff8e8;
        border-color: #efd9a2;
      }
      .wix-media-settings .actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 12px;
      }
      .wix-media-settings button {
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border: 1px solid #c5d0d8;
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: #fff;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .wix-media-settings button.primary {
        background: #116dff;
        border-color: #116dff;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .wix-media-settings .hint { font-size: 13px; color: #5a6f82; margin-top: 8px; }
      .wix-media-settings code { font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wix-media-settings">
      <h1>Media Manager</h1>
      <p>Project-level media operations for Wix Media Manager. API keys and OAuth secrets stay in <code>config/.wix.yaml</code> — edit in your IDE.</p>

      <section>
        <h2>About</h2>
        <p>Upload public assets with <code>jay-stack command wix-media/upload-public</code>, then rebuild the catalog so Add Menu and agent-kit references stay current.</p>
        <p>See <code>agent-kit/references/wix-media/MEDIA-INDEX.md</code> after rebuild.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Connection</h2>
        <div class="{connected ? status-card ok : status-card warn}">
          <div>{connectionMessage}</div>
          <div if="connected">Indexed files: {fileCount}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <button type="button" ref="refreshStatusBtn">Refresh status</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Catalog</h2>
        <p class="hint">Writes <code>agent-kit/aiditor/add-menu/wix-media.generated.yaml</code> and refreshes MEDIA-INDEX.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <button type="button" class="primary" ref="rebuildCatalogBtn">Rebuild media catalog</button>
        </div>
        <p class="hint" if="statusMessage">{statusMessage}</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
